    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BLAST Off into SPACEVENTURE! </strong>Become Ace Hardway, a &quot;Life Support Systems technician&quot; (let\u2019s be honest\u2014a space plumber), and his robotic dog, Rooter, on an epic intergalactic misadventure. When a routine repair job spirals into galaxy-spanning chaos, Ace finds himself battling sewer monsters, evading crooked cops, and uncovering a sinister conspiracy involving mind-controlling video game consoles. Along the way, you'll build a new spaceship, tinker with bizarre tech, and navigate quirky worlds filled with alien oddballs, unstable AIs, and absurd puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by the minds behind the beloved <i>Space Quest</i> series, <i>SpaceVenture</i> combines sharp humor, challenging puzzles, and nostalgic charm in a modern point-and-click adventure. Featuring stellar voice acting, a retro-inspired score, and endless nods to sci-fi classics, this crowdfunded game delivers a hilarious and heartwarming romp through the stars. Will Ace and Rooter save the galaxy or just make a cosmic mess? Only one way to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your  ship</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for parts, refuel with questionable bio-waste, and piece together your interstellar junker as you forge your path across the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a galaxy of interesting locales</strong> \u2013 From junk asteroids and sketchy space stations to alien deserts and the Hyperspace Beltway, every stop is packed with puzzles, and that trademark Two Guys from Andromeda humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact with unforgettable characters</strong> \u2013 Encounter crooked cops, eccentric inventors, shady CEOs, and a robotic dog with a nose for trouble. Everyone has a story... and some of them want you gone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve challenging puzzles with a comedic twist</strong> \u2013 Use your wits, tools, and trusty PDA apps to fix leaks, outsmart enemies, and uncover hidden truths about a galaxy-sized conspiracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BLAST Off into SPACEVENTURE! </strong>Become Ace Hardway, a &quot;Life Support Systems technician&quot; (let\u2019s be honest\u2014a space plumber), and his robotic dog, Rooter, on an epic intergalactic misadventure. When a routine repair job spirals into galaxy-spanning chaos, Ace finds himself battling sewer monsters, evading crooked cops, and uncovering a sinister conspiracy involving mind-controlling video game consoles. Along the way, you'll build a new spaceship, tinker with bizarre tech, and navigate quirky worlds filled with alien oddballs, unstable AIs, and absurd puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by the minds behind the beloved <i>Space Quest</i> series, <i>SpaceVenture</i> combines sharp humor, challenging puzzles, and nostalgic charm in a modern point-and-click adventure. Featuring stellar voice acting, a retro-inspired score, and endless nods to sci-fi classics, this crowdfunded game delivers a hilarious and heartwarming romp through the stars. Will Ace and Rooter save the galaxy or just make a cosmic mess? Only one way to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your  ship</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for parts, refuel with questionable bio-waste, and piece together your interstellar junker as you forge your path across the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a galaxy of interesting locales</strong> \u2013 From junk asteroids and sketchy space stations to alien deserts and the Hyperspace Beltway, every stop is packed with puzzles, and that trademark Two Guys from Andromeda humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact with unforgettable characters</strong> \u2013 Encounter crooked cops, eccentric inventors, shady CEOs, and a robotic dog with a nose for trouble. Everyone has a story... and some of them want you gone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve challenging puzz